  "description": "Wellsley College, the best gentleman training boarding school in England. The representatives of each dormitory there, Lawrence Siegenberg and Clifford Rochester, have an enmity that has continued since childhood. Then one day, 'Lawrence' is singled out by members of a secret school social club and invited to a 'fox hunt' where he is sexually harassed, and 'Lawrence', who is threatened to reveal the day's events, returns to the meeting while keeping it a secret from other students. I agree again. On the other hand, I felt desperate after learning the pleasure of accepting a man.\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Renta](https://renta.papy.co.jp/renta/sc/frm/item/149318), [Cmoa](https://www.cmoa.jp/title/1101205153/)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/public_animal), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/publicschool_beast)",
